-- "Buckler(OBSOLETE)" in the tooltip. Target subclass follows stock convention per slot:
--   InventoryType 14 -> 6 (Shield); 2/4/11/12/13/19/23 -> 0 (Miscellaneous); rest -> 1 (Cloth).
-- Companion changes already deployed: Custom/CSV DBC/Item.csv, Custom/DBCs/Item.dbc
-- (client patch-4 + server data/dbc) and Custom/CDBCs/DCCollectionTransmog.cdbc.

